{
  "tutorial": {
    "id": 4540,
    "version": 1,
    "type": "course",
    "isNew": false,
    "codeLanguage": "javascript",
    "title": "Klassen mit Methoden",
    "descriptionContent": "Erstelle interaktive Objekte, indem du Methoden zu Klassenvorlagen hinzufügst.",
    "shortDescriptionContent": "",
    "showInTrack": true,
    "iconBanner": null,
    "chapters": [
      {
        "id": 17679,
        "title": "Methoden",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 149910,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bis jetzt können die Objekte, die wir aus Klassen erstellt haben, in unserem Spiel keine Aktionen ausführen.</p><p>Indem wir <strong>Methoden</strong> zu Klassen hinzufügen, können wir interaktive Spielobjekte erstellen, indem wir Klassen als Vorlagen verwenden.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 149911,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Eine Methode in einer Klasse hinzuzufügen ist wie das Erstellen einer normalen Funktion, außer dass das <code>function</code>-Schlüsselwort nicht benötigt wird.</p><p>Diese <code>Player</code>-Klasse kann noch nicht viel. Lass uns ihr die Fähigkeit geben, Schaden zu nehmen, indem wir eine Methode hinzufügen.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"75\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeDamage() {}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>takeDamage</code>, gefolgt von <code>()</code> und schließlich <code>{</code>, <code>}</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 149912,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Innerhalb der geschweiften Klammern funktionieren Methoden wie normale Funktionen.</p><p>Lass uns <code>console.log</code> verwenden, um eine Nachricht in der Konsole anzuzeigen, wenn <code>takeDamage()</code> aufgerufen wird.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"90\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{ \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeDamage() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ouch!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>console.log</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 149913,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bevor wir die <code>takeDamage()</code>-Methode verwenden können, müssen wir ein neues Objekt aus der Klasse erstellen.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"107\" endIndex=\"112\" /><option startIndex=\"113\" endIndex=\"119\" /><option startIndex=\"120\" endIndex=\"121\" /><option startIndex=\"122\" endIndex=\"125\" /><option startIndex=\"126\" endIndex=\"132\" /><option startIndex=\"132\" endIndex=\"133\" /><option startIndex=\"133\" endIndex=\"138\" /><option startIndex=\"138\" endIndex=\"139\" /><option startIndex=\"139\" endIndex=\"140\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{ \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeDamage() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ouch!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ryu&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>const</code>, gefolgt von <code>player</code> und schließlich <code>=</code>, <code>new</code>, <code>Player</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>\"Ryu\"</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>;</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 149914,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um die <code>takeDamage()</code>-Methode zu verwenden, benötigen wir den Namen des Objekts, einen Punkt, den Namen der Methode und Klammern.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Ryu.takeDamage()\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"player.takeDamage\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"141\" endIndex=\"161\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{ \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeDamage() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ouch!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ryu&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player.takeDamage();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>player.takeDamage();</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 149915,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Parameter ermöglichen es Klassenmethoden, interaktiver zu sein, indem sie auf Dinge reagieren, die wir ihnen geben.</p><p>Füge dem <code>takeDamage()</code>-Methode einen Parameter namens <code>amount</code> hinzu.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"77\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeDamage(amount) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ouch!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ryu&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>amount</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 149916,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mit einer Bedingungsanweisung können die Objekte, die wir erstellen, auf die Menge an Schaden reagieren, die wir an <code>takeDamage()</code> übergeben.</p><p>Beende das Hinzufügen der Anweisung, die überprüft, ob <code>amount</code> einen bestimmten Wert hat.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"101\" /><option startIndex=\"136\" endIndex=\"140\" /><option startIndex=\"146\" endIndex=\"171\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeDamage(amount) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (amount === \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Big hit!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Small hit&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ryu&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player.takeDamage();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>if (amount === 10)</code>, gefolgt von <code>else</code> und schließlich <code>console.log(\"Small hit\");</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 149917,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jedes neue Objekt der <code>Player</code>-Klasse, das wir erstellen, wird in der Lage sein, die <code>takeDamage()</code>-Methode zu verwenden.</p><p>Rufe <code>takeDamage()</code> erneut auf, aber übergebe ihm diesmal <code>10</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"233\" endIndex=\"235\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeDamage(amount) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (amount === \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Big hit!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Small hit&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ryu&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player.takeDamage(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>10</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 149918,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welche dieser Möglichkeiten ist der richtige Weg, um mit der Erstellung einer Methode namens <code>update</code> innerhalb einer Klasse zu beginnen?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>update()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>function update()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>update()</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 149919,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kann das Aufrufen einer Klassenmethode einen Wert zurückgeben?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ja</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nein</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle Ja aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 149920,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welche dieser Aussagen über Klassen und Methoden ist wahr?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Objekte, die aus einer Klasse erstellt wurden, haben Zugriff auf deren Methoden</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Objekte haben keinen Zugriff auf die Methoden in einer Klasse</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Objekte, die aus einer Klasse erstellt wurden, haben Zugriff auf deren Methoden.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 149921,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Füge die korrekte Version einer Methode hinzu, die die Gesundheit des Spielers überprüft.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"healthLevel:\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"94\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"PlayerHUD\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(playerName) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".playerName = playerName;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" healthLevel() {}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>healthLevel()</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 149922,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Code den korrekten Weg, um die Klassenmethode von <code>PlayerHUD</code> zu verwenden.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"134\" endIndex=\"137\" /><option startIndex=\"137\" endIndex=\"138\" /><option startIndex=\"138\" endIndex=\"149\" /><option startIndex=\"149\" endIndex=\"150\" /><option startIndex=\"150\" endIndex=\"151\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"PlayerHUD\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(playerName) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".playerName = playerName;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" healthLevel() {}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hud = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" PlayerHUD(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ryu&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"hud.healthLevel();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>hud</code>, gefolgt von <code>.</code> und schließlich <code>healthLevel</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>)</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 149923,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Beende das Codieren der Methode, die den Punktestand des Spielers erhöht.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"75\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Score\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(points) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".points = points;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" increase() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".points = points + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>increase</code>, gefolgt von <code>(</code> und schließlich <code>)</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 149924,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Rufe die <code>increase</code>-Methode mit dem Argument <code>5</code> auf.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"score.increase = 5;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"143\" endIndex=\"161\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Score\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(points) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".points = points;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" increase(amount) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".points += amount;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Score(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"score.increase(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(score);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>score.increase(5);</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}